---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy policy | Tera Food & Supply"
  description="How Tera Food & Supply collects, uses and protects the personal information you share through our quote form."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy policy" title="Your information, in plain words.">
    <p>Last updated: <span class="ph">[date]</span></p>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container policy">
      <nav class="policy__toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <p class="policy__toc-title">On this page</p>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#who">Who we are</a></li>
          <li><a href="#collect">What we collect</a></li>
          <li><a href="#use">How we use it</a></li>
          <li><a href="#share">Who we share it with</a></li>
          <li><a href="#store">Where it's stored and for how long</a></li>
          <li><a href="#cookies">Cookies and tracking</a></li>
          <li><a href="#rights">Your choices</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Contact us</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <div class="policy__body">
        <section id="who">
          <h2>Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            Tera Food &amp; Supply Inc. is an Alberta company that designs and delivers custom packaging for food
            businesses in Calgary. This policy explains what personal information we collect through this website and
            what we do with it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="collect">
          <h2>What we collect</h2>
          <p>We only collect what you choose to send us through the quote form:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Your name, business name, email address and phone number</li>
            <li>Your type of business</li>
            <li>The packaging you're interested in, rough quantities and when you need it</li>
            <li>Any logo file you upload</li>
            <li>Anything you write in the message box</li>
          </ul>
          <p>You don't need to give us any information just to browse the site.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="use">
          <h2>How we use it</h2>
          <p>We use your information to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Reply to your request and prepare a quote</li>
            <li>Arrange a visit, if you'd like one</li>
            <li>Design your packaging, if you go ahead with an order</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We won't add you to a mailing list or send you marketing unless you ask us to. We never sell your
            information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="share">
          <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
          <p>We only share your information with services that help us run this website and reply to you:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Netlify</strong>, which hosts this website and receives the quote form</li>
            <li><strong>Our email provider</strong>, which delivers form notifications to us <span class="ph">[name of provider: confirm]</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            If you place an order, we share your logo and packaging design with the manufacturer that makes it. We don't
            share your contact details with them.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="store">
          <h2>Where it's stored and for how long</h2>
          <p>
            Netlify may store form submissions on servers outside Canada, including in the United States, where they may
            be subject to local laws.
          </p>
          <p>
            We keep quote requests for <span class="ph">[retention period: confirm]</span>, and keep customer records for
            as long as we need them to serve you and meet our legal and tax obligations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="cookies">
          <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
          <p>
            This website doesn't use advertising or analytics cookies. Our fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which
            means your browser connects to Google's servers when you visit.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="rights">
          <h2>Your choices</h2>
          <p>
            You can ask to see the personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it.
            Email us and we'll respond within 30 days.
          </p>
          <p>
            We handle personal information in line with Alberta's Personal Information Protection Act (PIPA). If you're
            not satisfied with our response, you can contact the
            <a href="https://oipc.ab.ca/" rel="noopener">Office of the Information and Privacy Commissioner of Alberta</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="contact">
          <h2>Contact us</h2>
          <p>Questions about this policy or your information:</p>
          <ul class="plain">
            <li>Email: <span class="ph">[email]</span></li>
            <li>Phone: <span class="ph">[phone]</span></li>
            <li>Mail: <span class="ph">[mailing address]</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p>If we change this policy, we'll update the date at the top of this page.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 15rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .policy__toc {
    position: sticky;
    top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--tera-green);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
  .policy__toc-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-stretch: 125%;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--kraft-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .policy__toc ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .policy__toc a { padding-block: 0.15rem; }

  .policy__body { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; max-width: 68ch; }
  .policy__body section { display: grid; gap: 0.85rem; scroll-margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .policy__body h2 { font-size: var(--step-2); }
  .policy__body ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; display: grid; gap: 0.4rem; }
  .policy__body ul li::marker { color: var(--kraft); }
  .policy__body .plain { list-style: none; padding: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .policy { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .policy__toc { position: static; }
  }
</style>
